1. Added `logo` property with a path to the Salesforce icon
2. Added `categories` array with "calendar" as a category
3. Added `slug` property for the app
4. Added `enabled` and `isInstalled` flags
5. Added `isSetupAlready` flag
6. Ensured all properties required by AppCard are present

These changes should resolve the TypeError that was occurring when trying to call `includes()` on the undefined logo property. The AppCard component should now have all the required properties to render correctly.

